#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:30
#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:57
#: 513625133ad849958f9ee0350e98f1b2 590a1ef17f3f4ea189d8027e9785caa6
#: 60c3c6ab69754456be9c73b53bc729b6 631b945034254f669185e36b578776bc
#: 7562131baaf54ac78003defdd32211b1 8b01fc9788d24da482d6c30ea3a8f869
msgid ""
"Affinity is only available with EKF3, so make sure you are using it by "
"ensuring :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` is set to \"1\" and "
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` is set to \"3\""
