#: cc00c0d15cdb4e89a8c4a3e5207bf62c ef4ed2edb5cc4e20be2d674ad1dbb05b
msgid ""
"An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 Magnetometers and "
"magnetometer affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. An "
"error is simulated in the primary lane's magnetometer by changing the offset"
" of the z-axis while flying. The offset change can be tracked with the 2nd "
"magnetometer. Subsequently, the EKF primary lane starts reporting a "
"consistently high error and a lane switch occurs when the error crosses the "
"set threshold."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 2 个磁力计且启用磁力计亲和性的固定翼飞行器通道切换示例。有 2 个 IMU，因此有 2 个活跃通道。通过在飞行时更改主通道磁力计的 Z "
"轴偏移量来模拟误差，偏移量变化可通过第 2 个磁力计跟踪。随后，EKF 主通道开始持续报告高误差，误差超过设定阈值时触发通道切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:8
#: 269609f282c5476d8c584f6ad2f946df 34195fa2e40c4d6e970ef5cae2be2920
#: 46a23af01b5242d9badbfc1600444cfb 8a66ffa6b1614594a2e1a189b20c306e
#: e6fb84a082824d72bd753f38c3afb588
msgid ""
"The :ref:`EKF <dev:extended-kalman-filter>` instantiates multiple instances "
"of the filter called 'lanes'. The \"primary\" lane is the one currently "
"providing state estimates, other lanes are updated in the background and "
"available for switching to."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EKF <dev:extended-kalman-filter>` "
"会实例化多个滤波器实例，称为\"通道\"（lane）。\"主\"通道是当前提供状态估计的通道，其他通道在后台更新，可供切换使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:13
#: 04839d9fc4a2483cb0a7e386ab1d80c7 290340ceaa6b42dfb90cad82afb5e059
#: 7a8456aace96464199fd14249e009657 7faaab11de4741d09dc76be63f569734
#: e2f85cbaad0546c3ab3cd9f8a9793603
msgid ""
"This page attempts to clarify an advanced configuration topic. The source "
"code is the truth."
msgstr "本页尝试阐明一个高级配置话题。源代码才是最终依据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:15
#: 0348e8a5d6414515811c74e2de21937a 4611daa0b7264d9d91eb9874135d9d67
#: 6faa7c33f96e45e495ff4def4f39d07f 7f71a2968e6b46c8b1b6dacb9f723098
#: bd89b687ab8a4a3cabcfd8fe974738a3
msgid ""
"The number of possible lanes is the number of IMUs enabled for use (see "
":ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK <EK3_IMU_MASK>`). Furthermore, the lanes are 1-1 bound to"
" the (used) IMUs: lane 1 for IMU 1, lane 2 for IMU 2, etc."
msgstr ""
"可能的通道数量等于启用使用的 IMU 数量（见 :ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK <EK3_IMU_MASK>`）。此外，通道与（所用）IMU "
"一一绑定：通道 1 对应 IMU 1，通道 2 对应 IMU 2，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:18
#: 7ea33393e9014d43a462d9ecc311d7a3 94aae119594b48e0aa12ed5c8a577790
#: a19c39fdfb5443118db5cd67b55c53e0 ba68c34692b945f0b2c55cef691adecd
#: f52c9908cf4b4ec58c2ce13b1688f561
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Now, consider the other sensor types {Airspeed, Barometer, GPS, and "
"Magnetometer (aka Compass)}. First, it is important to define the system's "
"notion of the \"primary\" sensor instance of each type. The primary sensor "
"instance is the instance being actively relied upon. The initial primary "
"sensor instance is selected by a user-modifiable parameter. The system may "
"change which sensor instance is its primary, even in-flight, for example in "
"case of a sensor fault. Thus \"changing the primary instance\" is one "
"mechanism the system can use to switch which sensor instance is being relied"
" upon."
msgstr ""
"现在考虑其他传感器类型｛空速计、气压计、GPS "
"和磁力计（即罗盘）｝。首先，需要定义系统中每种类型的\"主\"传感器实例的概念。主传感器实例是当前被实际依赖的实例。初始主传感器实例由用户可修改的参数选定。系统可能改变其主传感器实例，甚至在飞行中改变，例如在传感器故障时。因此\"更换主实例\"是系统用来切换所依赖传感器实例的一种机制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:25
#: 0948da3cbcb54fd0805a831e26012eca 47f81aabfbba462182a5c8b4b50e5f91
#: ca86f44e102244ae97f4cd42f5e0e3b3 db51c80006eb4f4080e77b5d9066a247
#: dc67de398433462b823d03e2cd7f080f
msgid ""
"A second mechanism for selecting which sensor instance to rely on is "
"provided by \"affinity\" & lane-switching. Because modern-day vehicles may "
"have redundant good quality sensors installed, affinity provides a way to "
"force some EKF lanes to prefer sensor instances which are not the system-"
"wide primary. If affinity for a sensor-type is disabled, each lane uses the "
"system's primary instance of the sensor. (Affinity being disabled is the "
"conventional/default choice.) If affinity for a sensor-type is enabled, the "
"sensor instances are distributed to lanes in a similar way as IMUs. Now with"
" affinity enabled, lane-switching becomes a mechanism for sensor-switching. "
"Each lane's error score---used by the system to make a switching decision---"
"takes into account innovations from all sensors used by that lane. Consider "
"a noisy but not faulted sensor for which affinity is enabled: it makes the "
"error-score for its lane bad. The system responds to the bad error score by "
"lane-switching away from relying on it. Thus a mishap may be avoided by "
"simply EKF lane-switching to a less-noisy IMU+sensor combination."
msgstr ""
"选择依赖哪个传感器实例的第二种机制由\"亲和性\"（affinity）与通道切换提供。由于现代载具可能装有多个冗余的高品质传感器，亲和性提供了一种方式，强制某些"
" EKF "
"通道优先使用并非系统全局主实例的传感器实例。若某传感器类型的亲和性被禁用，每个通道都使用系统的该传感器主实例。（禁用亲和性是常规/默认选择。）若某传感器类型的亲和性被启用，传感器实例会以与"
" IMU "
"类似的方式分配到各通道。此时启用亲和性后，通道切换就成为一种传感器切换机制。每个通道的误差评分——系统据此做出切换决策——会考虑该通道所用全部传感器的新息。设想一个噪声大但未故障、且启用了亲和性的传感器：它会使其所在通道的误差评分变差。系统对差的误差评分的响应是通过通道切换不再依赖它。因此，只需将"
" EKF 通道切换到噪声较小的 IMU+传感器组合，就可能避免一次事故。"

