msgid ""
"The :ref:`EK3_AFFINITY <EK3_AFFINITY>` parameter is a bitmask which gives "
"you the option to choose the sensors you want to enable affinity for. In "
"every EKF lane, sensors for which affinity is not enabled will follow the "
"system's \"primary\" selection logic. For a sensor-type with affinity "
"enabled, lane 1's primary sensor is 1, lane 2's primary sensor is 2, etc."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_AFFINITY <EK3_AFFINITY>` 参数是一个位掩码，可用于选择你希望启用亲和性的传感器。在每个 EKF "
"通道中，未启用亲和性的传感器将遵循系统的\"主\"选择逻辑。对于启用亲和性的传感器类型，通道 1 的主传感器是 1，通道 2 的主传感器是 "
"2，依此类推。"
